    slug: "alexanders-sister",
    name: "Alexander's Sister",
    description: "The gin-based and cr\u00e8me de menthe-influenced Alexander's Sister appears in Harry Craddock 's 1930 The Savoy Cocktail Book beneath the original gin-based Alexander Cocktail No. 1 and the brandy-based Alexander Cocktail No. 2 . ALEXANDER COCKTAIL. (No. 1.) \u00bd Dry Gin. \u00bc Cr\u00e8me de Cacao. \u00bc Sweet Cream. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass. ALEXANDER COCKTAIL. (No. 2.) \u2153 Cr\u00e8me de Cacao. \u2153 Brandy. \u2153 Fresh Cream. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass. ALEXANDER's SISTER COCKTAIL. \u2153 Gin. \u2153 Fresh Cream. \u2153 Cr\u00e8me de Menthe. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass. Ladies are advised to avoid this Cocktail as often as possible. Harry Craddock, 1930",
