    instructions: ["Select and pre-chill a COUPE GLASS.", "Prepare garnish of orange zest twist.", "SHAKE all ingredients with ice and strain back into shaker.", "DRY SHAKE (without ice).", "FINE STRAIN into chilled glass.", "EXPRESS orange zest twist over the cocktail and use as garnish."],
