    slug: "daiquiri",
    name: "Daiquiri",
    description: "Frozen daiquiris get all the attention, but the original was a simple shaken sour invented near Havana's Daiquiri iron mines. Hemingway's favorite was the Papa Doble \u2014 double rum, no sugar, just lime. A great daiquiri is tart, cold, and a little dangerous.",
