    instructions: ["Select and pre-heat a TODDY GLASS.", "Prepare garnish of grated nutmeg (and optional cinnamon stick).", "Place bar spoon in pre-warmed glass.", "POUR all ingredients into glass.", "Briefly STIR.", "Dust with grated nutmeg (and optionally garnish with cinnamon stick)."],
